{"at": "2026-10-11T18:46:21.908909+00:00", "event": "policy_audit", "approved": false, "issues": ["All 15 Python snippets fail the supplied static validator because their exception handlers access type(exc).__name__. The patches replace that forbidden attribute access while retaining safe exception diagnostics.", "The evaluator loses caller input on result re-entry, processes reading preferences after constructing the reading, and can discard the debt reading when a pending week change starts. Caller-first requests and newly supplied corrections need explicit preservation and single consumption.", "Several valid extraction outputs bypass the three-attempt rule: neutral/answer without a usable card, repeated ambiguous names, repeated outside requests, and email preparation answers without a usable currency. Card-selection failures also overwrite the active digit question and can lose its candidate scope.", "A card name and digits supplied together are not resolved together. Ordinary short labels containing conversational suffixes can fail matching. Switching cards during email or week stages is unsupported by those stages' extraction fields and can leave the previous card active.", "Email destination restrictions supplied at the offer are discarded. An unclear currency correction can leave a previous currency selected, and conflicting yes/period/currency fields can authorize the wrong request. The patches preserve restrictions and require a new confirmation after a correction.", "The week confirmation evaluator accepts yes with u_week=invalid, retaining the previous preview. An early week choice can also bypass the required presentation of the alternative weeks.", "The evaluator's exception fallback checks bank_event after popping it and checks phase_before_error without initializing it. Exceptions in week operations therefore use the wrong customer-facing failure sentence.", "A first-turn outside request can resume with no initialized question. Initial unsolicited secrets receive no required reminder on some paths. The patched evaluator initializes resumed speech and handles these interruptions before account disclosure.", "The supplied checks cover isolated snippets and prescribed extraction values only. They have not run and do not establish actual extraction, routing, speech, or phone behavior. The patches add regression cases and missing documented service-failure scenarios.", "Unresolved source/API conflict: once-per-calendar-year eligibility must be known before offering a change, but neither the call inputs nor any supplied endpoint exposes prior-year usage. The candidate assumes unknown means offerable. That assumption is not an approved bank amendment; no API-grounded patch can supply the missing fact.", "Unresolved integration blocker: every destination ultimately invokes a hangup terminal. Setting handoff_destination does not perform a main-menu, agent, or IVR-login transfer. The supplied API has no transfer operation or documented adapter flag, so a functioning transfer cannot be invented in JSON Patch. Approval remains blocked until that integration contract is supplied.", "The closing scenario for the spouse request is conditional on the caller getting an opportunity before immediate termination. It does not establish the complete behavior required by Example 5; actual dialogue and handoff validation remain necessary."]}
